atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/017aa5aee9365650017e15845641df19.mp4?t=1746819834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Megabattle, each victory brings valuable rewards in the form of parts and upgrade cards. Utilize these resources to enhance your deck, making your robot more powerful and resilient. During battles, strategically play cards to improve your parts, attack opponents, and defend against enemy assaults.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/70b2326dcf0c721a87b1546ccbedfb1e.poster.avif?t=1746819834\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/70b2326dcf0c721a87b1546ccbedfb1e.webm?t=1746819834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/70b2326dcf0c721a87b1546ccbedfb1e.mp4?t=1746819834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore various robot classes, each with their own unique characteristics and obtainable parts. Discover new attack cards and exclusive power-ups to strengthen your arsenal and adapt to different battle strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/5c391d8a735085bf30ed5f9c73497d40.poster.avif?t=1746819834\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/5c391d8a735085bf30ed5f9c73497d40.webm?t=1746819834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602030/extras/5c391d8a735085bf30ed5f9c73497d40.mp4?t=1746819834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With an immersive sci-fi/futuristic atmosphere, Megabattle transport